1. In vacuum and mop mode, if the robot's wheels come into contact with cleaning solution or large amounts of water, there is a chance that the wheels may slip and cause the robot to rotate. You can adjust the mopping setting to a lower water level to see if the issue improves.

2. Please ensure you are using the low-foam cleaning solution specifically designed for this model;

If the above troubleshooting steps do not resolve the issue, please provide the device ID, enable the activity log switch in the app, and provide a video of the abnormal behavior. We will forward the issue to the technical department for analysis and processing, and will respond to you as soon as possible. <https://service.eufy.com/article-description?ref=Home_Page&urlName=What-information-does-eufy-need-to-resolve-a-technical-issue-with-my-E28-robot>

If the robot is set to vacuum-only mode but performs sweeping and mopping, please follow the steps below to troubleshoot: To start the room task or scenario task, you need to set the cleaning mode for each room separately. If it is not set, the default is the vacuum and mop mode. Please reset it and confirm whether the task is executed normally. At the same time, our product team is evaluating the one-click setting function, and it can be optimized by upgrading the firmware later;

Tips:

1. After turning on the "dirty cleaning" function, when the ground stains such as coffee are identified, a deep fine mopping action will be performed, and the pure sweeping task will also be triggered. If you don't want the ground to be wet during the pure sweeping work, you can turn off this function;

2. When the threshold is identified, the software logic will lower the roller to assist, helping the sweeper to cross the threshold faster, and the pure sweeping task will also be triggered. If you don't want the ground to be wet during the pure sweeping work, it is recommended to perform the pure sweeping task after the roller is thoroughly dried;

If there is a problem of dust box clogging, it is recommended that you turn on the pet mode in APP, if you are a multi-pet household, it is recommended that you set the dust collection frequency to 15min dust collection; clean the dust box & filter and restart the task;

Tips:

