* 1. Restart the robot and router;
* 2. Check whether the WIFI account and password are correct;
* 3. Make sure the Wi-Fi router frequency band is set to 2.4GHz (only supported) or switch to another 2.4GHz Wi-Fi;
* 4. Place the station as close to the router as possible to avoid wall obstruction and signal blind spots;



If the above troubleshooting steps fail to resolve the issue, please provide the following information for further analysis:

* Router brand and model
* Photos showing the router's physical appearance
* Detailed screenshots of your router's Wi-Fi settings interface
* A complete video recording of the Wi-Fi connection process

